  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">FEP:BA-L1002 Programa de Vivienda y Mejoramiento de Barrios</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEF:BA-L1002 Housing and Neighborhood Upgrading Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de esta operacin es apoyar al Gobierno de Barbados en la preparacin del programa de Vivienda y Mejoramiento de Barrios (BA-L1002), a travs del financiamiento de consultoras para completar estudios tcnicos y diseos detallados para las cuatro comunidades piloto de bajos ingresos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this Individual Operation is to assist the Government of Barbados in furthering preparation of the Neighbourhood and Housing Upgrading Program (BA-L1002) through the financing of consultancies to complete technical inputs and detailed designs for four pilot low-income communities.</narrative>
  </description>
